  "derivation": "The bound external lane carries a user-chosen name, not the ensure declaration's creation field (external-lane). Reuse validation checks only type, parent and containment property, the processRef/owner relationship and the single binding (DESIGN §5.2; H C5: declared ensure fields are creation fields, a renamed bound support is reused unchanged): the lane is reused, never renamed back, and supports are never found by name. The marked Call_ext is already its member, so the appendUnique is a no-op; no effective change is gated, so the edit activation accepts with no entry (fixed point). Report header (H B4): sourceIdentity and targetIdentity are the envelope identity, inputRevision is baseRevision, outputRevision is revision.",
